<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 18, 2004 :: Dragons and Fun!</div><P>We had a busy week! We managed to take down an additional three First Brood dragons! Congrats to Zavitar and Cerdiwan! </P>
<P>Meeka edit: Oops, and belated grats Arid on your prismatic, and Mah on getting the elusive fistwraps and Papa on skull on a stick bonus weapon! Also belated grats to Jenrenee on Yel's talisman, Grajin on his head, me on a robe nobody wanted and Perragon,&nbsp;Wellish and Desultor nabbing some toys! I now return you to the rest of Wond's edit.. Oh! After saying thanks to Wond for leading the west coasters out to kill Vindi after us east coasters sat back and relaxed. Well, or went to bed so we could get up for work. Something like that. </P>
<P>We've had quite a few levels as well!</P>
<OL>
<LI>Bufo 40th! 
<LI>Punkgurl 62nd! 
<LI>Milora 59th! 
<LI>Dalorm 56th! 
<LI>Wellish the High Priest at 60th!! 
<LI>Turtleman 45th! 
<LI>Speid 40th!</LI></OL>
<P>Keep up the levels everyone! It shall be an interesting week!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Wonderous<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jan 20, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 15, 2004 :: More levels and dragons</div><P>Ran and killed another dragon fastlike to get Aridius his Sleepers Key finally, go go bard power! Then we ran and showed Kelerok'Dar what massive overkill was really like. We let Nefarius tank! </P>
<P>Grats Edko on 65 and Archon!<BR>Grats Brytelyte on 62! <BR>Grats Punkgurl on 61!<BR>Grats Snot on 53!<BR>Grats Thrakish on 50! (did I already get this one?)<BR>Grats Tman on 44!<BR>Grats Emanci on Sensei!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 13, 2004 :: Welcome to our newest officer!</div><P>Welcome to Arglar, Cimerene and BOB.. err.. Jakr as our newest officers! We will arrange a time to punt Arglar to celebrate soon!</P>
<P>These were some of the levels I missed...<BR>Grats Raining on 65 and Arcanist!<BR>Grats Zorin on 62!<BR>Grats Thrakish on 48!<BR>Grats Turtleman on 43!<BR>Grats Bashiuss on Sir!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 12, 2004 :: Rings and Kings</div><P>Another relaxing Ring War... no, this time it wasn't an evil one! I got to chat and relax mostly on bard duty! </P>
<P>Grats Emanci on your 10th Ring, Zelcon on your Crown of Narandi and Thayet on your Choker of the Wretched! None of the heroes died, but I forget exactly who got the rest of those loots. </P>
<P>After all that nice coldain faction work, we decided to go stuff the Dain for his head! Who says you need to bring DPS to that fight? /rolls eyes </P>
<P>Anyways... grats Mahrsan on Dain's head and you're swanky new belt! Reide saved the tri-plated hammer of instant clicking shielding goodness from rot, Vorne saved the Aegis of Ice from rot, and two others got the Frostreavers Cloak and Ring of Winter on greed. Seriously, great fun fight! Shows how determined we are. </P>
<P>I know there are some levels that should go here...</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 10, 2004 :: Lots of old news..</div><P>I had a picture, it was snazzy and all, but I can't seem to find it.. I'll get a replacement though! Grats Garetjax on completing your epic blades finally! They make you look extra sexay!<BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/gj1.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Reivan on completing your Staff of the Four as well! <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/reivan.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Had a few more visits to Sleepers, more folks got prismatic, killed some uglies in Plane of Disease, got another person keyed for Sleepers, killed the great white dragon again. And... some levels!</P>
<P>Grats Kasiryn on 65 and Prophet!<BR>Grats Valenae on 65 and Arch Lich!<BR>Grats Punkgurl on 60 and Crusader!<BR>Grats Perragon and Wellish on 59!<BR>Grats Dalorm on 55 and Beguiler!<BR>Grats Kaisey on 52!<BR>Grats Myistical on 46!<BR>Grats Turtleman on 42!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jan 11, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 4, 2004 :: Grats Talyss and Beryllin!!</div><P>Big grats to the newly married couple!</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/wedding.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jan 5, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 3, 2004 :: Happy New Year!</div><P>With the new year we got ourselves some new levels!<BR>Grats Bashiuss on 65 and Dread Lord!<BR>Grats Mytee on 65 and Coercer!<BR>Grats Iionz&nbsp;on 60 and Assassin!<BR>Grats Aelfric on 60 and Warder!<BR>Grats Zorin on 60 (and 61) and High Priest!<BR>Grats Punkgurl and Mabh on 57!<BR>Grats Gargaden on 55 and Luminary!<BR>Grats Scheni on 55 and Beguiler!<BR>Grats Turtleman on 40!</P>
<P>Visited the big ugly in Fear and killed him, killing his friends along the way. Golems were very cheap, as always. Grats Morlith on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics3/soulleech.jpg">Soul Leech</A>, Lumalie and Moordread each got <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/zombie_flesh_bracer.jpg">Zombie Flesh Bracers</A>, Colwn and Kantar got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/brainofcazicthule.jpg">Brain of Cazic Thule</A> and Beryllin and Lairiel both got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/cloakofthefearsome.jpg">Cloak of the Fearsome</A>. </P>
<P>Weekly Sleepers visit found Arglar with a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Warsword.jpg">new sword</A>, Jen with a pretty <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Lance.jpg">lance</A>, Papa with a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Guilded_Wyvern_Claw.jpg">new neck</A>, Wonder with <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/wings_of_duress.jpg">some wings</A> and more quest items for the questers. </P>
<P>Klandicar donated a neck for Arglar, and we ran the dwarfie to visit the big dead guy for his key. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 30, 2003 :: Undead horsey!</div><P>Looked around for something to do, and found Vhaksiz the Shade up and waiting to die. Rounded up some folks and crawled through the caves up to his penthouse apartment and killed him. Grats Thayet on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/flame_engraved_torque.jpeg">Flame Engraved Torque</A> and greed roll winners on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/disemboweler.jpg">Disembowler</A> and <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/BlackSilkCap.jpg">Black Silk Cap</A>, a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/sinew_tied_bone_earring.jpeg">Sinew Tied Bone Earring</A> found on the way up. </P>
<P>Sure there's been more leveling, and I nominate Wonderous to update that! ;)</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=5'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=4'>4</a> <a href='news.asp?page=5'>5</a> 6 <a href='news.asp?page=7'>7</a> <a href='news.asp?page=8'>8</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=7'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
